{
  "_comment": {
    "crazy_taxi": "Cabinet physical controls = wheel + 2 pedals (accel->r2, brake->l2) + gear lever (up/down) + START. There are NO face/action buttons, so every extra game function must be reached through a START + lever up/down combo.",
    "combos": "A combo with a 'modifier' is gated by it; a combo with no modifier is a plain remap (mod-code 0). Trigger/emit names are the cab controller-config names available on crazy_taxi: up, down, l2, r2, start, and (as combo emit targets) a, b, x, y, l1, r1.",
    "_rotate": "Applied when the game rotates controls (TATE / vertical screen): a 90-degree face-button rotation (remaps), the analog-stick remap (axes) and its sign flips (invertAxes). D-pad is not rotated (a rotated cab's stick is physically rotated)."
  },
  "_rotate": {
    "remaps": { "east": "b", "south": "y", "north": "a", "west": "x" },
    "axes": { "joystick1up": "r_y", "joystick1left": "r_x", "joystick2up": "l_x", "joystick2left": "l_y" },
    "invertAxes": ["joystick2up"]
  },
  "naomi": {
